	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Free-form unit and currency conversion.

  conv 100 usd cny      100 USD in yuan
  conv 100 usd          100 USD in every favourite currency
  conv 1200*3 hkd sgd   the amount may be arithmetic
  conv $100 to jpy      currency symbols work ($ ¥ € £ HK$ S$ …)
  conv 10 km mi         units, across 12 dimensions
  conv 72 f c           temperature
  conv 1 gb mib         decimal and binary byte ladders

↩ copies the bare number, ⌘↩ copies it with the unit.

Exchange rates are cached under $XDG_CACHE_HOME/alfred-convert and
served stale-while-revalidate, so the filter never waits on the
network. Sources: open.er-api.com, falling back to the ECB via
api.frankfurter.dev. Fiat only. Refresh by hand with `rates.py`.

Source of truth: ~/.dotfiles/config/AlfredApp/convert (this directory
is a symlink into it).

Replaces deanishe's alfred-convert 3.7, which needed Python 2, pint
and Alfred-Workflow — none of which survive on a modern macOS.</string>
